---
/** Inline so the hero paints with the HTML. Not the LCP image request. */
---
<svg
  class="hero-svg"
  viewBox="0 0 560 480"
  width="560"
  height="480"
  role="img"
  aria-labelledby="hero-ill-title"
>
  <title id="hero-ill-title">A short reading path: learn what bitcoin is, spot the scams, then decide slowly.</title>
  <circle cx="390" cy="230" r="180" fill="var(--soft)" />
  <rect x="86" y="78" width="360" height="330" rx="28" fill="var(--teal)" opacity="0.35" />
  <rect x="64" y="58" width="360" height="330" rx="28" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2" />
  <circle cx="400" cy="108" r="52" fill="var(--amber)" stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2" />
  <circle cx="400" cy="108" r="34" fill="var(--navy)" />
  <rect x="388" y="96" width="24" height="24" rx="5" fill="var(--teal)" />
  <text x="92" y="108" fill="var(--navy)" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="28">A calm path</text>
  <text x="92" y="136" fill="var(--muted)" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="15">Three pages. Then you decide.</text>
  <g>
    <circle cx="112" cy="188" r="16" fill="var(--amber)" stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <text x="112" y="194" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--navy)" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="16">1</text>
    <text x="142" y="194" fill="var(--ink)" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="18">What bitcoin is</text>
  </g>
  <g>
    <circle cx="112" cy="248" r="16" fill="var(--amber)" stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <text x="112" y="254" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--navy)" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="16">2</text>
    <text x="142" y="254" fill="var(--ink)" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="18">Scams to spot</text>
  </g>
  <g>
    <circle cx="112" cy="308" r="16" fill="var(--amber)" stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <text x="112" y="314" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--navy)" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="16">3</text>
    <text x="142" y="314" fill="var(--ink)" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="18">A slower first buy</text>
  </g>
  <path d="M92 348 h180" stroke="var(--link)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
  <text x="92" y="376" fill="var(--muted)" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="14">A source sits next to every fact.</text>
</svg>
